SUMMARY:RKTHOL — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: ROCKET COMPANIES INC (RKTHOL)\nRoadshow: https://evercall.co/oacc/
 25528\n\nDeal context:\nRocket Companies\, Inc. is launching a two-tranche
  senior unsecured high-yield offering totaling $1.2 billion\, comprising a
  $600 million 5-year (2031) NC2 tranche and a $600 million 8-year (2034) N
 C3 tranche\, both distributed via 144A/Reg S. Initial price talk is Mid-6%
  on the 5-year and High-6% on the 8-year\, with the deal announced on June
  9\, 2026\, alongside a same-day global investor call. Proceeds are intend
 ed to repay the 2026 Rocket Mortgage Notes and certain other indebtedness\
 , with Goldman Sachs acting as left lead alongside BofA\, JPM\, MS\, and W
 FS as joint bookrunners.
